-- Update descriptions for all 20 premium diecast brands with 3-line summaries
UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A highly boutique, collector-focused brand known for releasing extremely limited, themed premium diecast collections. Each model is characterized by exquisite artistry, exclusive packaging designs, and a strong emphasis on rare Japanese and Asian car culture. Designed as artistic showpieces, they are highly sought after by collectors seeking exclusivity and exceptional presentation.'
WHERE slug = 'ar-box';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A specialized boutique manufacturer renowned for producing highly limited-run and historically accurate vehicle replicas. They focus on rare classics, custom modifications, and specific motorsport models that are often overlooked by mainstream diecast producers. Featuring sharp castings, authentic factory paint finishes, and high-fidelity details, BMC is a must-have for discerning collectors.'
WHERE slug = 'bmc';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'The definitive industry leader in producing officially licensed, large-scale construction, forestry, and heavy work vehicle replicas. Renowned for outstanding mechanical precision, their models feature fully functional movable parts, real rubber tracks, and detailed operator cabs. Primarily recreating Caterpillar machinery, DCM captures the absolute ruggedness and massive scale of industrial giants in stunning diecast metal.'
WHERE slug = 'dcm';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A premium artisan diecast creator dedicated to high-end craftsmanship and museum-quality static display models. Every release showcases meticulous attention to panel gaps, photo-etched metal parts, and multi-layered premium paint schemes. Designed purely for display, Fine Works offers the ultimate visual depth and structural weight for seasoned collectors.'
WHERE slug = 'fine-works';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'The dedicated 1:64 scale division of Fine Works, delivering artisan-level quality in the popular miniature footprint. Focuses on high-end sports cars and modified street machines with precision-engineered details like custom wheels and interior scale dashes. Offers collectors the same premium paint, authentic decals, and sharpness as larger models at a fraction of the display space.'
WHERE slug = 'fine-works-64';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A celebrated American diecast brand world-famous for its officially licensed replicas of Hollywood movie cars, television icons, and historic US muscle. Renowned for series like ''Hollywood'' and ''Barrett-Jackson'', their models feature opening hoods, detailed engine bays, and authentic movie decals. Spanning a rich variety of scales, Greenlight is the perfect crossover brand for automotive enthusiasts and pop culture fans alike.'
WHERE slug = 'greenlight';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A rising star in the 1:64 diecast community specializing in affordable yet finely detailed scale vehicles. HKM captures iconic Japanese and European road cars, adding realistic metal badges, detailed lights, and distinct wheels. Their balance of cost and craftsmanship makes them exceptionally appealing to both casual hobbyists and seasoned collectors.'
WHERE slug = 'hkm';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'An absolute powerhouse in the 1:64 scale community, famous for ultra-detailed JDM, touring car, and Asian market exotics. Known for their incredible decals, vibrant racing liveries, and accurate aerodynamic body kits that perfectly mirror real-world track cars. Delivered in premium acrylic cases with themed display bases, INNO64 models stand as the crown jewels of modern car culture collections.'
WHERE slug = 'inno64';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A unique, highly specialized diecast brand highlighting the rich and diverse car culture of South and Southeast Asia. They focus on regional classics, retro utility vehicles, and custom street modifications popular in Asian automotive circles. Offering crisp castings and culturally authentic detailing, Maasdi brings a distinctive regional flavor to any global collection.'
WHERE slug = 'maasdi';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'The gold standard for modern 1:64 scale collectors, delivering jaw-dropping, officially licensed supercars, hypercars, and tuner vehicles. Features robust metal chassis, rolling rubber tires, incredibly detailed light lenses, and flexible mirrors that resist breakage. Combining collector-grade precision with high structural durability, MiniGT has revolutionized the global miniature car hobby.'
WHERE slug = 'minigt';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A niche brand highly regarded for producing premium, limited-run replicas focusing heavily on Asian street tuner culture. They excel at crafting custom wheel designs, widebody tuner kits, and unique custom paint variants in exceptionally small batches. Highly sought after for their rarity, Mini Station models represent the cutting edge of modern urban car styling.'
WHERE slug = 'mini-station';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'An artisan manufacturer dedicated to capturing classic and contemporary Asian road cars with immense precision. Their models boast clean body lines, highly detailed interiors, and accurate manufacturer badging that highlights real automotive history. A staple for collectors who appreciate clean, stock-spec vehicles and traditional JDM cruisers.'
WHERE slug = 'mj-model';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'An edgy, street-inspired diecast brand known for bold custom designs, slammed stances, and eye-catching urban liveries. They focus on the VIP style, custom camber setups, and aggressive aftermarket wheel designs that dominate modern stance culture. Each model is packed with attitude, making Mortal the ultimate brand for showcasing the wilder side of custom street tuning.'
WHERE slug = 'mortal';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A fast-growing premium brand from Hong Kong delivering highly detailed 1:64 replicas of iconic Japanese, European, and motorsport vehicles. Renowned for incorporating functional features like opening hoods, opening trunks, and steerable front wheels in a tiny scale. Featuring outstanding paint finishes and officially licensed liveries, PopRace models perfectly bridge high detail with interactive play.'
WHERE slug = 'poprace';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A custom-tuner brand focused on capturing the raw power and aggressive styling of modern street racing culture. Their models feature aggressive body kits, realistic exhaust setups, and detailed interior roll cages that evoke track-day thrills. Built for collectors who live for high-horsepower street cars, custom engine swaps, and underground racing aesthetics.'
WHERE slug = 'street-warrior';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A legendary Hong Kong-based brand celebrating global motorsport heritage, famous for highly detailed racing cars and hot hatches. Partnered with major racing teams and automakers, they deliver flawless replicas of GT3, rallying, and classic touring cars. Packaged in their iconic collector boxes or acrylic displays, Tarmac Works captures the thrilling spirit of the racetrack.'
WHERE slug = 'tarmac-works';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A major collector brand known for highly accurate, licensed 1:64 replicas, often accompanied by matching scale figures. They are famous for creative paint schemes, customized delivery vans, and partnerships with anime/pop culture properties. Highly diverse and beautifully presented, TimeMicro models add immense character and visual storytelling to any display shelf.'
WHERE slug = 'timemicro';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'Japan''s premier diecast brand since 1970, globally renowned for its legendary pocket-sized cars featuring working spring suspensions. Their Tomica Limited Vintage (TLV) line offers the absolute peak of 1:64 scale accuracy with diecast chassis and authentic retro designs. Bridging generations of play and high-end adult collecting, Tomica is an essential cornerstone of the entire diecast hobby.'
WHERE slug = 'tomica';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A lifestyle-focused diecast brand dedicated to capturing popular car culture trends, custom trucks, and overland vehicles. They excel at representing modern off-road styling, rooftop tents, camping gears, and outdoor lifestyle aesthetics. Trends Hobby brings the adventurous spirit of outdoor exploring and modern utility trucks directly to your collection.'
WHERE slug = 'trends-hobby';

UPDATE public.brands
SET description = 'A premier Chinese brand celebrated for highly detailed 1:64 scale replicas of domestic Chinese vehicles, public transit, and commercial trucks. They offer incredibly sharp castings, working suspensions, authentic utility lights, and exceptionally detailed public transport liveries. Xcartoys provides a fascinating, high-quality look into the diverse world of Chinese automotive history and modern daily transport.'
WHERE slug = 'xcartoys';
